@startuml

hide footbox
title US002 - Register an Appraisal Entity

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":AppraisalController" as AppraisalController
participant ":AppraisalEntityRepository" as AppraisalEntityRepository

Administrator -> UI : **1** addAppraisalEntity(name, contact)

UI -> AppraisalController : **2** addAppraisalEntity(name, contact)
activate AppraisalController

AppraisalController -> AppraisalEntityRepository : **3** addNewAppraisalEntity(name, contact)
activate AppraisalEntityRepository

create "apEntityXPTO: AppraisalEntity" as AppraisalEntity
AppraisalEntityRepository -> AppraisalEntity : **4** create(name, contact)


    AppraisalEntityRepository -> AppraisalEntityRepository : **5** validateToAdd(apEntityXPTO)


AppraisalEntityRepository --> AppraisalController : **6** true
deactivate AppraisalEntityRepository

AppraisalController --> UI : **7** success
deactivate AppraisalController

UI --> Administrator : **8** success

@enduml
